WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.840
Okay, a little bit of a problem.

2
00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:22.310 line:15%
We went to the wrong airport.

3
00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.080 line:15%
And now we're all jumping in five different cabs

4
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.470 line:15%
and rushing to Conan Town.

5
00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.760 line:15%
Be there soon.

6
00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.730 line:15%
Very nice to meet you.

7
00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.040 line:15%
It's an honor.

8
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.050 line:15%
Honor.

9
00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:42.940
Hi, how are you?

10
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:45.440
This is the Bill Nye of Japan.

11
00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:48.903
Very good.

12
00:01:48.903 --> 00:01:52.260
During the Bush to the Clinton.

13
00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.310
Oh, Bush to Clinton.

14
00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.143
Yes.

15
00:01:54.143 --> 00:01:57.720
You know, in America, we eventually let go of the hand.

16
00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.670
Eventually.

17
00:01:58.670 --> 00:01:59.503
You can let go at any,

18
00:01:59.503 --> 00:02:00.600
it's your call.

19
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.433
You have.

20
00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:04.766
He has a vice-like grip, and he won't...

21
00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:12.230
I'm the mayor?

22
00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.317
Yes.

23
00:02:17.792 --> 00:02:19.110
I have a sash for you.

24
00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.943
You are now Miss Iowa.

25
00:02:26.982 --> 00:02:28.090
Because I am mayor for the day,

26
00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.560
I would like to make him Conan for the day.

27
00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.893
It's a good fit.

28
00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.370
Excuse me?

29
00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.040
Yes, I want to cash this check.

30
00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.040
Tell him it's for three trillion yen.

31
00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.873 line:15%
Yes, so I would like to cash this.

32
00:02:55.453 --> 00:02:57.071
No, no.

33
00:02:57.071 --> 00:02:57.904
No.

34
00:02:59.396 --> 00:03:00.437
No.

35
00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.101
I'll get you all.

36
00:03:03.101 --> 00:03:04.648
I'll be back.

37
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.130
In a triumph of international cooperation,

38
00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.140
the burgers came from Australia.

39
00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.890
Courtesy of the Aussie Beef Guys.

40
00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:39.427
That's all I can do in Japanese.

41
00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.650
I traveled 6,000 miles to be here.

42
00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.483
The mayor only traveled 25 meters.

43
00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.820
We gather here today to agree that I am the real,

44
00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.208
original Conan.

45
00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:57.458
You have been worshiping a false god.

46
00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.250
But I forgive you.

47
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.104
The mayor's hand is on my bottom.

48
00:04:01.104 --> 00:04:03.180
(audience laughing)

49
00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.097
And he's not moving it.

